---
// What a sealed disclosure shows in place of its details: two lines under bars. The words are in
// the markup for a screen reader and for anyone who selects them, and say only that they are held.
---
<p data-redacted>
  <span class="redact">Program and vendor withheld until publication.</span>
  <span class="redact">Impact class withheld until publication.</span>
</p>

<style>
  .redact {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: transparent;
    background: #05080b;
    user-select: none;
  }
</style>
